WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:04.639
"We have to save my family!" Darla cried.

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.528
"But how?"

3
00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:11.069
"We'll follow the arrow," Cora said.

4
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.579
[i@Whoosh!@i] The arrow took off.

5
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.829
They swam after it.

6
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:23.358
"Are you sure this will work?" Darla asked.

7
00:00:23.359 --> 00:00:26.349
"Yes!" Mo said.

8
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:30.399
Suddenly the arrow stopped.

9
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:40.061
Mo looked around. "I don't see a net."

10
00:00:40.062 --> 00:00:44.454
"We're too late!" Darla cried.

11
00:00:44.455 --> 00:00:49.766
"Wait," Cora said, "the arrow is turning."

12
00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:54.320
[i@Zip!@i] The arrow flew back the other way.

13
00:00:54.321 --> 00:00:57.888
"Where's it going?" Darla asked.

14
00:00:57.889 --> 00:01:01.655
"I don't know!" Cora was worried.

15
00:01:01.656 --> 00:01:06.638
"The algae broke the arrow!" she thought.

16
00:01:06.639 --> 00:01:11.880
The arrow zoomed back to the reef.

17
00:01:11.881 --> 00:01:15.629
It pointed to Cora's den.

18
00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:23.419
"That arrow is broken!" Darla moaned.

19
00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:31.161
"Um," Mo said. " Who's that?"

20
00:01:31.162 --> 00:01:35.226
Some butterfly fish swam out of Cora's den.

21
00:01:35.227 --> 00:01:39.175
"My family!" Darla yelled.

22
00:01:39.176 --> 00:01:46.459
"Darla!" her mom cried. "We found you!"

23
00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:51.044
"You escaped from the net," Cora said.

24
00:01:51.045 --> 00:01:54.104
Darla's family nodded.

25
00:01:54.105 --> 00:02:00.066
"But . . ." Mo frowned. "How did you find Darla?"

26
00:02:00.067 --> 00:02:03.486
"Easy!" her mom said.

27
00:02:03.487 --> 00:02:07.580
"Everyone said to look for Cora."

28
00:02:07.581 --> 00:02:13.457
Darla cheered. "The best helper in the sea!"

29
00:02:13.458 --> 00:02:24.869
Cora bowed and waved good-bye.

30
00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:34.945
"Finally," she thought. "I can nap!"

